      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KISSES FOR RUBY (3) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (26.18) at this track behind Fishing Yari in a Grade 4/5. Expected to feature in the finish again. AVANT DANGER (2) has been hard to follow lately, running fourth (30.45) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at this track. Expected to do much better this time. DIP THE DONUT (1) doesn't win out of turn but looks close to breaking through. Has been in the minors the last two runs, the latest finishing third (30.40) at Launceston. Expected to be in this for a long way. PRESSING MATTERS (4) can feature with the right run.",
